<title>USA: Bay Pond holds 7.44 pct Broadway stake.</title>
<headline>Bay Pond holds 7.44 pct Broadway stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay Pond Partners LP said Friday it holds a 7.44 percent stake in Broadway Financial Corp or 66,400 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Bay Pond said it bought its stake between May 16 and August 14 at prices ranging from $10 to $10.1250 per share.</p>
<p>Bay Pond said it bought the shares for investment purposes.</p>
